{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119774","id":3746846030,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7fVFVO","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119774","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119774.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119774.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119774","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119774/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119774/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119774/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8d7342c282fe44d4b7d0da70dca826c6a00a61c8","number":119774,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"GDScript: Implement safe navigation operator (?.) for get, set, and call","user":{"login":"Mrfanta-stick","id":105064999,"node_id":"U_kgDOBkMqJw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/105064999?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick","html_url":"https://github.com/Mrfanta-stick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mrfanta-stick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Description:\r\nImplements the safe navigation operator (?.) in GDScript. This allows property get/set and method calls on null or freed objects to silently skip execution and evaluate to null instead of throwing a runtime error.\r\n\r\nImplementation Details:\r\n\r\n1) Parsing: Added tokenization and AST parsing for the ?. operator (represented via is_null_safe flags on nodes).\r\n\r\n2) Opcodes: Introduced OPCODE_GET_NAMED_SAFE, OPCODE_SET_NAMED_SAFE, OPCODE_CALL_SAFE, and OPCODE_CALL_SAFE_RETURN to the GDScript bytecode schema (gdscript_function.h).\r\n\r\n3) VM Logic: Modified `gdscript_vm.cpp` dispatch loop to handle the new safe opcodes. If the base object evaluates to Variant::NIL or is a previously freed instance (via is_instance_valid checks), the operation is skipped and a null Variant() is assigned to the destination address.\r\n\r\n4) Code Generation: Added write_get_named_safe, write_set_named_safe, and write_call_safe to `gdscript_byte_codegen.cpp` and `gdscript_compiler.cpp` to route instructions when is_null_safe is detected.\r\n\r\n5) Performance: The logic is isolated into distinct _SAFE opcodes instead of branching standard opcodes, maintaining zero performance loss for existing non-safe GDScript execution.\r\n\r\nExample usage:\r\n```\r\nvar node = get_node_or_null(\"Player\")\r\n\r\n# Safe Property Get / Set\r\nvar health = node?.health \r\nnode?.health = 100 \r\n\r\n# Safe Method Call\r\nnode?.queue_free() \r\n\r\n# Deep Chaining\r\nvar enemy_name = get_node_or_null(\"Target\")?.get_parent()?.name\r\n```\r\n\r\nWorks on https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/1902\r\n\r\n(P.S. This PR has been intentionally converted to a draft to decouple the Runtime Execution from the Static Analyzer Architecture.\r\n- Safe Navigation (?.) is Fully Operational: The core C++ VM opcodes, stack allocation, and runtime execution loops are complete and verified (Any other edge cases, if found, and suggestions are most welcome).\r\n- The Elvis Operator (?:) Adding the null-coalescing fallback requires the engine to natively support internal nullable/union types (Type | Nil) within gdscript_analyzer.cpp making it a structural roadblock.)","labels":[{"id":73330068,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2OA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/feature%20proposal","name":"feature proposal","description":"","color":"4466ff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_